      "text": "\n**Programme:** 2024\n\n## Jungle, volcano and Pacific coast\n\nThe route starts in San José and heads to the Caribbean canals of Tortuguero. Spend the first few days exploring the tropical forest and watching for wildlife.\n\nYou then drive on your own through the Arenal Volcano area and Monteverde to the Pacific coast. The final days are spent around Manuel Antonio National Park, where the rainforest meets white-sand beaches and coral reefs.\n"
